SOP (EN+ES): wiki CTA loses the emoji and gains a CTA row (dossier,
podcast, film studio); proof ticker with figures read from production
(181K LOC, 122 essays, 12 wiki chapters, 11 episodes, 6 films);
scroll-driven reveal + card shine; lab table rows for wiki, dossier,
publishing engine, film studio, pitch; grounded-blog copy; concierge
step names Claude Fable 5 + its watchdog; new pipeline step 7 —
automatic lead search staged into HubSpot with tested WhatsApp links
and one-click email, auto deal-stage moves, +4d follow-up tasks, and
delivered/opened marked from true Resend webhook events; dead AILA
repo link now points at hive.

Pitch: Atlas row + radar CTA; CMO tiles for Fable 5 concierge and
HubSpot autopilot; fleet watchdog on the solution slide; 15 months,
181K LOC, 1,166 roles, 6 films, 82 commands, two-layer memory;
dossier/audit/podcast/film CTAs. ES translations updated in-deck.
